@startuml
title Investment strategy communication
object "customer:Customer" as C
object "router:FeatureHubRouter" as R
object "strategies: InMemoryInvestmentStrategyStore" as M
C -> R : 1: PUT /investments/U-88/strategy [optionIds]
R -> R : 1.1: validate IDs against catalogue
R -> M : 1.2: save(strategy for U-88)
M --> R : 1.3: saved strategy
R --> C : 2: success, illustrative-demo
C -> R : 3: GET /investments/U-88/strategy
R -> M : 3.1: get("U-88")
M --> R : 3.2: saved strategy
R --> C : 4: strategy, process-memory
note bottom
FeatureHubRouter and strategies Map links are modeled in system-service-classes.puml.
feature-hub-scenario.test.cjs checks valid persistence and rejects unknown options.
This is sample information, not market data or financial advice.
end note
@enduml
